Cumbria LRF - Penrith boil water incident - SITREP 3
Time of report: 16/01/2026 1100

1. SITUATION
Incident status: ACTIVE - response
Boil water notice covers approx. 14,500 properties.

2. SITES AND ROUTES
- Castle Park bottled water station: open 08:00-20:00
- Eamont Moor Water Treatment Works: out of service (run by United Utilities)
- Penrith Leisure Centre: OPEN for collection (run by United Utilities)
- QEGS Penrith: closed to pupils

3. AGENCIES RESPONDING
Westmorland and Furness Council, NCIC, United Utilities, UK Health Security Agency

4. NEXT MEETING
SCG at 1000. Dial-in details as previously circulated.

